  "aiPreviewTitle": "Your analysis request",
  "aiShareHint": "Review the complete text below. Choose an app from the share menu, or copy the text and paste it into ChatGPT. Available apps depend on your device. Submit the request in the chosen app to receive an analysis. Sharing includes this plan’s name and saved study history.",
